&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fintech or financial services experience, or familiarity with fintech product structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of privacy issues in a commercial context.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with a deal desk team.&lt;/li&gt;
