&lt;li&gt;Act as the subject matter expert, evaluate complex, non-routine transactions and provide technical accounting guidance and disclosure recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iterate and develop GAAP accounting policies and support high-impact business initiatives such as post-merger integration and product launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain a robust library of corporate accounting policies; lead the implementation of new FASB/ SEC standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and maturation of an internal control environment in preparation for integration with Capital One’s financial reporting standards and SOX requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, Legal and other teams to provide proactive accounting for new product launches and business model changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely close through the preparation and review of journal entries, reconciliations and variance analytics, as well as coordination with FP&amp;amp;A&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
