&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of experience directly managing software or infrastructure engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep hands-on experience with cloud infrastructure foundations, specifically AWS, Kubernetes, and Postgres.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural Insight:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to design and implement complex infrastructure projects such as multi-region deployments or disaster recovery frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong communication skills with the ability to influence technical decisions across multiple autonomous teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to dive deep into technical issues while maintaining a high-level strategic view of organizational goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Background:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience in software or systems engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
