&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with a finance-first mindset and comfortable speaking the language of CFOs, Controllers, and FP&amp;amp;A teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to synthesize product usage data into strategic recommendations&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;that drive tangible customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in cross-functional collaboration and influencing internal roadmaps based on customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree required; finance, business, or related fields preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
