&lt;li&gt;Translate business and technical strategy into clear people and org implications, proactively identifying risks and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach leaders on building high-performing teams, including hiring profiles, succession planning, and internal mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead org design efforts including defining structure, driving communication plans, and owning execution through rollout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive clarity around roles, scope, and leveling, ensuring consistency and rigor across Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
